{"id":"H1074","lemma":"בֹּֽכְרוּ","transliteration":"bokheru","sayIt":"bo-khe-ru","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Bocheru","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 1Ch.8.38;\nson of: Azel (H0682A);\nbrother of: Azrikam (H5840H), Ishmael (H3458I), Sheariah (H8187), Obadiah (H5662J) and Hanan (H2605H)\n§ Bocheru = \"firstborn\"\na Benjamite","glosses":["bocheru"],"count":2,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"1ch-8","v":38,"renderings":{"bsb":"Bocheru","kjv":"Bocheru"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-9","v":44,"renderings":{"bsb":"Bocheru","kjv":"Bocheru"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"1 Chronicles 8:38","note":"Azel had six sons, whose names are these: Azrikam, Bocheru, Ishmael, Sheariah, Obadiah, and Hanan. All these were the sons of Azel.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H0682","lemma":"אָצֵל","transliteration":"atsel","gloss":"Azel"},{"id":"H5840","lemma":"עַזְרִיקָם","transliteration":"azriqam","gloss":"Azrikam"},{"id":"H3458","lemma":"יִשְׁמָעֵאל","transliteration":"yishmael","gloss":"Ishmael"},{"id":"H8187","lemma":"שְׁעַרְיָה","transliteration":"shearyah","gloss":"Sheariah"},{"id":"H5662","lemma":"עֹבַדְיָ֫הוּ","transliteration":"ovadyah","gloss":"Obadiah"},{"id":"H2605","lemma":"חָנָן","transliteration":"chanan","gloss":"Hanan"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}